{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":169.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-406,"img":"chara031_0","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":169.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-406,"img":"chara031_0","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]啧……刚刚衣服又沾上肮脏的泥土了，回去得好好清洗一番才行。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]要不是你的营地在这里，我才不会不远万里来到这片未开发的蛮荒之地呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]你难道不考虑搬去更文明的地方吗？虽然深渊里谈不上有这种地方，但总比这满是杂草的大草原要好。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]哼……刚刚看见有一只蚊子飞了过去，果然是肮脏的荒地。我想你迟早会受不了这地方的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]啊……？你说会加紧研制除蚊装置？你这家伙……到底听不听得懂人话啊……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"波特温-友善3","script":"yd_031_03"}